ted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in v4.8.dev1.official [ebbf577a0] onwards\n- not reproducible in v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz) - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 5GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - AMD Ryzen 9 9900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 31.10 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nNode.is_ancestor_of() returns true when the node passed as the argument is the same node as the caller.\nThis appears to be a regression/bug introduced by this optimization: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111165\n\n```\n\tconst Node *n = node;\n\n\tif (is_inside_tree() && node->data.tree == data.tree) {\n\t\tconst int depth = data.depth;\n\t\twhile (n->data.depth > depth) {\n\t\t\tn = n->data.parent;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn n == this;\n\t}\n```\n\n`n->data.depth > depth` is immediately false when `n == this`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n`is_ancestor_of(self)` on any node\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122909/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}